aurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"E_HZHSOrXy621e9jeI8R7w","review_id":"MfilU0F518zC_RpMbGJ2Aw","date":"2010-10-07T17:17:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9068836569786072,"text_excerpt":"I like Parkview. I like the outside tables and the semi-stale but free popcorn and the very, very cheap Abita on tap with tokens so you can drink your pitcher in moderate, pint-sized portions and then save some for next time. I like Bunchie and Chris and their free food at Saints games, especially the hogshead cheese shaped like a fleur-de-lis made by the inimitable Vaughn of Creole Country Meats. The downside to the whole place is that it's just so smoky:("},{"business_id":"E_HZHSOrXy621e9jeI8R7w","review_id":"t7EekVlL5MlHMPmJbqc9-A","date":"2019-12-18T22:36:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9032858610153198,"text_excerpt":"Best drink prices in the city. The regular wells are $3 but happy hour they're $2.25! Man you can't beat this at all, only my second time here but the people are so welcoming and cool. Would definitely recommend!"},{"business_id":"E_HZHSOrXy621e9jeI8R7w","review_id":"hIXymRtZsmxv-a0DuMwMIg","date":"2014-01-19T16:52:26","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9025720357894897,"text_excerpt":"I love to catch Saints games here! They've always got some good food and a great pitcher special (with drink tokens so you don't have to sit around and watch your beer go flat). The regulars make a great crowd to watch with too. Who Dat!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"E_HZHSOrXy621e9jeI8R7w","photo_id":"Id4seHUhe3NhINXbeE8yyg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Id4seHUhe3NhINXbeE8yyg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9036703109741211},{"business_id":"E_HZHSOrXy621e9jeI8R7w","photo_id":"I1H19optD7UrFOfM0V9Gbw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/I1H19optD7UrFOfM0V9Gbw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9036702513694763}]},"not